msgstr "2. Objet et champ d'application"

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:82
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    The English Grows website provides information about\n"
"                    its training services and access to its online learning\n"
"                    platform. Certain features are publicly accessible,\n"
"                    while others require registration or authorised access.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Le site web English Grows fournit des informations sur\n"
"                    ses services de formation et donne accès à sa plateforme\n"
"                    d'apprentissage en ligne. Certaines fonctionnalités sont accessibles au public,\n"
"                    tandis que d'autres nécessitent une inscription ou un accès autorisé.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:91
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    Access to the website does not, by itself, establish\n"
"                    a contractual relationship for paid training services.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    L'accès au site web n'établit pas, à lui seul,\n"
"                    de relation contractuelle pour des services de formation payants.\n"
"                "

