msgid ""
"\n"
"                    The registered commercial name and its graphical\n"
"                    representation are protected under applicable\n"
"                    industrial property legislation.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Le nom commercial enregistré et sa représentation graphique\n"
"                    sont protégés par la législation applicable\n"
"                    en matière de propriété industrielle.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:125
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    The website's original design, texts, graphics,\n"
"                    educational materials and other protected content\n"
"                    belong to their respective rights holders and are\n"
"                    protected under applicable intellectual property law.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    La conception originale du site web, les textes, les graphiques,\n"
"                    les supports pédagogiques et les autres contenus protégés\n"
"                    appartiennent à leurs titulaires de droits respectifs et sont\n"
"                    protégés par la législation applicable en matière de propriété intellectuelle.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:134
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    Access to the website does not transfer ownership\n"
"                    of its content or authorise its reproduction,\n"
"                    redistribution or commercial exploitation without\n"
"                    the appropriate permission, except where permitted\n"
"                    by law.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
