"                    de son contenu et n'autorise pas sa reproduction,\n"
"                    sa redistribution ou son exploitation commerciale sans\n"
"                    l'autorisation appropriée, sauf dans les cas permis\n"
"                    par la loi.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:147
msgid "4. Acceptable use"
msgstr "4. Utilisation acceptable"

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:150
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    Users must access and use the website and learning\n"
"                    platform lawfully and in accordance with their intended\n"
"                    purposes. Unauthorised access, interference with the\n"
"                    platform's operation, infringement of third-party "
"rights\n"
"                    and activities compromising its security are "
"prohibited.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Les utilisateurs doivent accéder au site web et à la plateforme\n"
"                    d'apprentissage et les utiliser de manière licite et conformément à leur\n"
"                    finalité. Tout accès non autorisé, toute perturbation du\n"
"                    fonctionnement de la plateforme, toute atteinte aux droits de tiers\n"
"                    et toute activité compromettant sa sécurité sont interdits.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:160
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    Registered users must safeguard their account "
"credentials\n"
"                    and notify English Grows if they suspect unauthorised\n"
"                    access to their account.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Les utilisateurs inscrits doivent protéger les identifiants de leur compte\n"
"                    et informer English Grows s'ils soupçonnent un accès non autorisé\n"
"                    à leur compte.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:171
msgid "5. External links"
msgstr "5. Liens externes"

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:174
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    The website may contain links to independent third-"
"party\n"
"                    websites and services. These are governed by their own\n"
"                    applicable terms and privacy notices.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Le site web peut contenir des liens vers des sites web et services\n"
"                    indépendants de tiers. Ceux-ci sont régis par leurs propres\n"
"                    conditions applicables et politiques de confidentialité.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:182
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    English Grows does not control the content or operation\n"
"                    of independent third-party websites. Nothing in this\n"
"                    section excludes responsibilities arising under\n"
"                    applicable law.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    English Grows ne contrôle ni le contenu ni le fonctionnement\n"
"                    des sites web indépendants de tiers. Aucune disposition de la présente\n"
"                    section n'exclut les responsabilités découlant\n"
"                    de la législation applicable.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:194
msgid "6. Training services and privacy"
msgstr "6. Services de formation et confidentialité"

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:197
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    Paid training services are governed by the applicable\n"
"                    Terms and Conditions, training proposal or individual\n"
"                    contractual agreement, including the relevant pricing,\n"
"                    payment, scheduling and cancellation provisions.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Les services de formation payants sont régis par les\n"
"                    conditions générales applicables, la proposition de formation ou le contrat\n"
"                    individuel, y compris les dispositions pertinentes relatives aux tarifs,\n"
"                    au paiement, à la planification et à l'annulation.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:206
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    Information about the processing of personal data,\n"
"                    data protection rights and the use of cookies is\n"
"                    provided in our Privacy Policy, accessible through\n"
"                    the website footer.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Les informations relatives au traitement des données à caractère personnel,\n"
"                    aux droits en matière de protection des données et à l'utilisation des cookies\n"
"                    figurent dans notre Politique de confidentialité, accessible depuis\n"
"                    le pied de page du site web.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:218
msgid "7. Applicable law and updates"
msgstr "7. Droit applicable et mises à jour"

#: .\home\templates\home\legal_notice.html:221
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    This Legal Notice is governed by Spanish law,\n"
"                    without prejudice to any mandatory provisions\n"
"                    applicable to users, including statutory consumer\n"
"                    rights and jurisdictional protections.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
