msgstr "Pendant les durées requises par la législation commerciale, comptable et fiscale applicable."

#: .\home\templates\home\privacy_policy.html:672
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    When information is no longer required for\n"
"                    its original purpose or another valid retention\n"
"                    basis, it is deleted or anonymised where appropriate.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
